    "privacy_html": "<h2>Privacy Policy</h2><p>The Owner informs you about its <b>Privacy Policy</b> regarding the processing and protection of personal data of users that may be collected while using the mobile application (“the App”).</p><p>In this regard, the Owner guarantees compliance with the applicable personal data protection regulations, as reflected in the <b>Spanish Organic Law 3/2018</b>, of December 5, on the Protection of Personal Data and Guarantee of Digital Rights (LOPD GDD). It also complies with <b>Regulation (EU) 2016/679</b> of the European Parliament and of the Council of April 27, 2016, on the protection of natural persons (GDPR).</p><p>Use of the App implies acceptance of this Privacy Policy as well as the conditions included in the Legal Notice.</p><h3>Identity of the Controller</h3><ul><li><b>Controller:</b> NUTRENAISSANCE S.L.U.</li><li><b>Tax ID:</b> B42981100</li><li><b>Address:</b> Calle de Peña Goñi, 2. 02 IZ., Gipuzkoa - Spain</li><li><b>Email:</b> info@nutrenaissance.com</li><li><b>Website:</b> https://nutrenaissance.com</li></ul><h3>Principles Applied in Data Processing</h3><p>When processing your personal data, the Owner will apply the following principles in line with the GDPR:</p><ul><li><b>Lawfulness, fairness, and transparency:</b> Consent will always be required for processing personal data for one or more specific purposes, which will be previously communicated with full transparency.</li><li><b>Data minimization:</b> Only the data strictly necessary for the stated purposes will be collected.</li><li><b>Storage limitation:</b> Data will be kept only as long as necessary for the purposes of the processing. For subscriptions, inactive records will be periodically reviewed and deleted.</li><li><b>Integrity and confidentiality:</b> Data will be processed in a way that ensures security, confidentiality, and integrity. The Owner takes all necessary precautions to prevent unauthorized access or misuse.</li></ul><h3>Collection of Personal Data</h3><p>To use the App, you must create an account and provide certain personal information. The data collected may include:</p><ul><li><b>Identification data:</b> name, surname, email address, and login credentials.</li><li><b>Basic health and nutrition data:</b> weight, height, body mass index (BMI), muscle mass, and other measurements you choose to provide in order to use the App’s features.</li><li><b>Usage data:</b> interactions with the App, preferences, and activity logs necessary for improving the service.</li></ul><p>This information is essential for the App to provide personalized nutrition-related services. By entering this data, you consent to its collection, use, and processing in accordance with this Privacy Policy.</p><h3>User Rights</h3><p>You have the right to:</p><ul><li>Request access to your stored data.</li><li>Request rectification or erasure.</li><li>Request limitation of processing.</li><li>Object to processing.</li></ul><p>The right to data portability does not apply.</p><p>The exercise of these rights is personal and must therefore be carried out directly by the data subject by sending a request, along with a copy of a valid ID, to: <b>info@nutrenaissance.com</b>.</p><p>The exercise of these rights does not include any data the Owner is obliged to keep for administrative, legal, or security purposes. You also have the right to effective judicial protection and to lodge a complaint with the <b>Spanish Data Protection Agency</b> if you believe your data has been misused.</p><h3>Purpose of Data Processing</h3><p>When you use the App, send an email to the Owner, or subscribe to a newsletter, you are providing personal information (such as IP address, name, surname, physical address, email address, phone number, etc.). By providing this information, you consent to its collection, use, management, and storage under the terms described in this Privacy Policy.</p><p>The purposes of data processing include:</p><ul><li>Ensuring compliance with the Legal Notice and applicable law.</li><li>Improving the services offered through the App.</li><li>Managing the Owner’s presence on social media platforms.</li></ul><p><b>Social Media:</b> If you follow the Owner on social networks, data processing will be governed by this Privacy Policy and by the terms and conditions of each social platform. The Owner will use social media data only to manage its presence and inform you about activities, never to send individual advertising.</p><h3>Data Security</h3><p>To protect your personal data, the Owner takes all reasonable precautions and follows industry best practices to prevent loss, misuse, unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction.</p><p>Your data will not be shared with third parties except when legally required or when necessary for service provision (with your prior consent and under strict security measures).</p><h3>Third-Party Content and Services</h3><p>The App may include links or embedded content (e.g., videos, articles) from external websites. These sites may collect data, use cookies, and track your interaction. The Owner is not responsible for the processing of personal data by external websites.</p><h3>Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h3><p>The App may use cookies or similar technologies necessary for its proper operation. For more information, please review the applicable cookie notices or settings available within the App.</p><h3>Legal Basis for Processing</h3><p>The legal basis for processing your data is your consent.</p><h3>Categories of Personal Data</h3><ul><li>Identifying data.</li><li>No special categories of data are processed.</li></ul><h3>Data Retention</h3><p>Personal data will be kept until you request its deletion.</p><h3>Data Recipients</h3><p><b>Google Analytics:</b> A web analytics service provided by Google Inc. (1600 Amphitheatre Parkway, Mountain View, California, CA 94043, USA). Google Analytics may use cookies to analyze App usage. Data may be stored on servers in the United States. More information: Google Privacy Policy.</p><h3>Non-Identifying Data</h3><p>When using the App, non-identifiable data may be collected, such as IP address, geolocation, usage patterns, and browsing habits. This data is used for statistical analysis and service improvement.</p><h3>Accuracy of Personal Data</h3><p>You agree that the data provided to the Owner is accurate, complete, and up to date, and you are solely responsible for its accuracy.</p><h3>Acceptance and Consent</h3><p>By using the App, you acknowledge that you have been informed of the terms regarding personal data protection, and you accept and consent to the processing of your data as described in this Privacy Policy.</p><h3>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h3><p>The Owner reserves the right to update this Privacy Policy to adapt it to legal changes or industry practices. This Privacy Policy will remain in effect until replaced by a duly published updated version.</p>",
    "privacy_title" : "Privacy Policy",
    "tip_text" : "<p>Based on your profile, we recommend foods to include in your diet, differentiated by color.</p>\n<ul><li><b class=blue-text>In blue</b>, foods related to your goals.</li>\n<li><b class=green-text>In green</b>, foods recommended to help you meet the minimum requirements of all micronutrients.</li>\n<li><b class=yellowish-green-text>In a neutral color</b>, foods you consume frequently.</li></ul>\n<p>Select a food to add it to your list.</p>",
